# Implementation Plan - Separate Auth Pages & Navbar

The goal is to transition from a sliding overlay to dedicated, centered card-based pages for Login and Register, and to implement a matching "Apple-Developer" style Navbar.

## Proposed Changes

### [Layout & Navigation]
#### [NEW] [Navbar.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/ui/Navbar.tsx)
- Minimalist top navigation.
- Glassmorphism (`backdrop-blur`).
- Links to "Terminal" (Home), "Login", and "Register".

#### [MODIFY] [layout.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/app/layout.tsx)
- Integrate the `Navbar` to appear on all pages.

